# DTS-WEB V2 — Project Core

- Product: DTS (Digital Transformation Services) marketing site for dts-eg.com
- Work only in this repo (`DTS-WEB V2`). Treat `C:\Users\PC\Desktop\DTS-WEB` as content/assets/product reference only

## Official stack (do not replace)

- Vue 3 with `<script setup>`, Vite, Tailwind CSS 3, vue-i18n 9, vue-router 4
- Plain JavaScript — no TypeScript, no Pinia unless explicitly requested

## Product defaults

- Arabic-first; RTL for `ar`, LTR for `en`
- Copy lives in `src/locales/{ar,en}/` — never hardcode UI strings in templates

## Documentation and plans

- Structural docs only under `docs/` (English filenames and content)
- Wave plans and status only under `plans/` (English)
- Do not treat `docs/archive/` as canonical
- Chat vs docs language: see `language.mdc`
- Delivery cycle: see `workflow.mdc`

## Agent boundaries

- Change only files needed for the current task
- Do not copy legacy reference code patterns (`useLanguage`, per-section CSS files, dead router stubs)
